{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_01",
      "hash": "2862f3f0a8471eb5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希巴：我是四天王中的希巴！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_05",
      "hash": "2862eff0a84717e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "无论是人还是宝可梦，\\n只要经历了战斗的锤炼，\\r\\n就能使实力突破极限！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_06",
      "hash": "2862ecf0a84712d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我就是在这样的锤炼中\\n和我的格斗属性宝可梦\\r\\n一起生活，一起成长！\\r\\n今后也会如此！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_07",
      "hash": "2862edf0a8471483",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你叫[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，对吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_08",
      "hash": "2862faf0a8472a9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你就好好见识一下\\n我们的强大力量吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_09",
      "hash": "2862fbf0a8472c4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哼——哈——！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_shiba_01_p02_cave_d1402",
      "hash": "72418348ba117edb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_02",
      "hash": "2862f0f0a847199c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希巴：既然输了，\\n我们的登场也就到此为止！\\r\\n好了！你继续往前走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_03",
      "hash": "2862f1f0a8471b4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希巴：我在这里也感受到了\\n你与科拿对战时的势不可挡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_10",
      "hash": "2865f8f0a8495d0b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接下来我要让你见识\\n同样势不可挡，经历千万锤炼的\\r\\n格斗属性宝可梦们的实力！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_11",
      "hash": "2865f7f0a8495b58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哼——！哈——！\\n哼——！！哈————！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8110_combat_04",
      "hash": "2862eef0a8471636",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可恶！\\n是我的修行还不够吗……\\c\\n你不需要顾虑我，\\n继续向前走吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8110_max",
      "hash": "ec1bedabba5a271d"
    }
  ]
}
